[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3092377048","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108424#issuecomment-3092377048","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108424","id":3092377048,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64Ue3Y","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-19T14:21:38Z","updated_at":"2025-07-19T14:21:38Z","body":"The thing is that they can't really be synchronized, because they do different things:\n- The \"Pause Project\" freezes the game's OS process, making so that it can't be interacted at all.\n- The \"Debug Pause\" halts the game's inner processing (`_process()`, `_physics_process()`, etc), and stills allow the user to interact with it, which is necessary for the related features to work.\n\nAnd about the icons, while them both sharing the same one isn't ideal, I can't really think of anything else that could substitute it for either of them.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3092377048/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095212556","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108424#issuecomment-3095212556","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108424","id":3095212556,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64fTIM","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T04:56:15Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T04:56:15Z","body":"Differentiating the icons is a tough one. Anything would help, though.\nHere are a few quick suggestions:\n(I suggest changing Debug Pause)\n- Change the artstyle\n- Use ellipses instead of rectangles\n- Use a double tilde `≈` rotated by 90°\n- Rotate the icon, e.g. so that it looks italic\n- Add a background, e.g. a circle\n\nMaybe also add a description to clarify further, similiar to Pause Project.\nCurrently, it only says `Suspend`, which could mean anything.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pi